name: Git index cache writes preserve Map while actual staged source stays visibly stale
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/index_freshness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | actual-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
submit: modules
type: operator source draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/index_freshness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART cache
wait: 3
live-snap: cache-write-settled
expect: operator source draft
expect-not: workspace:stale
ask: Does a proven cache-only index rewrite keep the same Map, selected surface and unsent draft without a stale-inventory alarm or new work?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/index_freshness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stage
require-live-snap: 25 workspace:stale inventory | real-index-change
expect: operator source draft
keys: Escape
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 workspace:stale inventory | stale-source-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 workspace:stale inventory | stale-source-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 workspace:stale inventory | stale-source-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 ⚠ stale | stale-source-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 ⚠ stale | stale-source-40x12
ask: Is the real source change visible without advancing the journey, accepting new context or taking over input at the tested terminal sizes?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/index_freshness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART screens
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: map
wait: 2
live-snap: stale-map-restart
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/index_freshness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 y/Y exit | protected-plan-exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
